  "Offer your seat to someone who needs it more.",
  "Put your phone away when someone is talking to you.",
  "Be on time or inform others if you are running late.",
  "Treat waiters and service staff with respect.",
  "Walk on the side closest to traffic when walking with a partner.",
  "Wait until everyone has their food before you start eating.",
  "Introduce people to each other who have not met before.",
  "Include quiet or left-out individuals in conversations.",
  "Ensure the people you care about get home safely."
 ],
 "content": "Instagram post caption: Manners that make you stand out🤌🏼 #advice #men. Transcript: No. 1 never arrive empty handed when you're invited somewhere over. No. 2 offer your seat to someone who needs it more than you. No. 3 put your phone away when someone is talking to you. No. 4 be on time or at least let people know if you're running late. No. 5 always treat waiters and service staff with respect. No. 6 and listen to this twice when you're walking together with your girl take the side closest to the traffic. No. 7 wait until everyone has their food before you start eating. No. 8 introduce people who haven't met each other before. No. 9 bring someone quiet or left out into the conversation and No. 10 make sure the people you care about get home safely. Follow for more on manners, confidence and attraction. Text on screen: 10 MANNERS FOR MEN",
